    {
      "_id": "2OUOBIN4TJDoL0sJ",
      "name": "Strength Drain",
      "type": "weapon",
      "img": "icons/magic/death/hand-withered-gray.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>[[/attack extended]]. [[/damage extended]].</p><p>The target's Strength score is reduced by [[/r 1d4]]. The target dies if this reduces its Strength to 0. Otherwise, the reduction lasts until the target finishes a short or long rest. If a non-evil humanoid dies from this attack, a new @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.bestiaire.Actor.QpuS5OSg9HcVaalb]{shadow} rises from the corpse 1d4 hours later.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Dr4nS7r3ngthN0te\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Appliquez l’effet <em>Strength Drain</em> correspondant au jet de [[/r 1d4]] : il disparaît au prochain Short ou Long Rest de la cible. La mort à Strength 0 n’est pas automatisée.</p></section>",
          "chat": "<p>The [[lookup @name]]{monster} attacks with its [[lookup @item.name]].</p>"
        },
